<title>USA: AccuMed sets 1-for-3 reverse split.</title>
<headline>AccuMed sets 1-for-3 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuMed International Inc said Tuesday its board had approved a one-for-three reverse stock split.</p>
<p>The company said it will file with the Securities and Exchange Commission to seek shareholder approval of the reverse split.</p>
<p>AccuMed said it now has about 22 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>AccuMed makes laboratory diagnostic products.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
